OL,3,GStrathclyde
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FIt will be cloudy with some
OL,6,Foutbreaks of rain through the day,
OL,7,Fheaviest and most persistent for north
OL,8,FArgyll and the Isles, but some
OL,9,Fbrighter spells across the Greater
OL,10,FGlasgow area.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FRather cloudy with rain in
OL,13,Fthe evening, though perhaps some drier
OL,14,Fspells for Greater Glasgow at first.
OL,15,FRain becomes persistent and heavier
OL,16,Fovernight.
OL,17,
OL,18,CWednesday:FCloudy with heavy rain at
OL,19,Ffirst, this clearing in the morning.
OL,20,FThe mostly dry through the rest of the
OL,21,Fday with increasing bright spells.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
